{{wikipedia|dab=Corkscrew (disambiguation)|Corkscrew}}
==English==
[[File:Korkenzieher 01 KMJ.jpg|thumb|A corkscrew.]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈkɔːk.skɹuː/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈkɔɹk.skɹu/}}
* {{audio|En-us-corkscrew.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[cork]][[screw]]}}

# An implement for [[open]]ing [[bottles]] that are sealed by a [[cork]].
#: ''Using a '''corkscrew''', I opened the wine bottle.''

====Coordinate terms====
* [[bottle opener]], [[church key]], [[wine key]]

